a little bit over rotated but not bad marks from the judges who quite like what they see 3.2 the degree of difficulty so the sevens will give them a decent score now then a 3.6 degree of difficulty a couple of those in this round for the Mexican Rodrigo Diego Lopez back two and a half somersault two and a half twists

